From 751d602507377de271530e7f647751959ae29183 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juuso Alasuutari <juuso.alasuutari@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 09:53:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] shmctl: use getopt and the shared control settings

This commit rewrites the dlssnr-shmctl command line with getopt short
and long options. Settings, their offsets and their defaults come from
common/control_settings.h.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
